glmark2 22c527cb (2023.01): the pbuffer-glesv2 flavour, glmark2-es2-pbuffer,
for YakoGL's Mali pair on the NanoPC-T6 (tools/cts/mali-glmark2-build.sh).

- native-state-pbuffer.{h,cpp}: a native system with no window system; its
  "window" is the size of an EGL pbuffer surface on EGL_DEFAULT_DISPLAY.
- gl-state-egl.cpp: with GLMARK2_USE_PBUFFER, configs with EGL_PBUFFER_BIT
  and eglCreatePbufferSurface(EGL_WIDTH, EGL_HEIGHT) instead of
  eglCreateWindowSurface.
- main-loop-picture.h: the main loop with the per-scene picture line of
  driver/docs/glmark2.md "The picture value" on stderr (glReadPixels at the
  scene's last frame, before its swap). With GLMARK2_FB=1 in the environment
  it also prints the scene's whole frame on stderr as the "glmark2-fb:" dump
  of driver/docs/glmark2.md "The frame dump" (the code and format of
  glmark2-host-ref.patch, which tools/cts/glmark2-fb.py decodes); unset or
  any other value, nothing more is printed.
- main.cpp: the pbuffer native state and loop; the data directory beside the
  program (<dir>/bin/.., share/glmark2) unless --data-path is given.
- meson_options.txt, meson.build, src/meson.build: the flavour.

